{"4492080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Life & Shadow: Celestial Call - Prologue", "steam_appid": 4492080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PREPARE BY DAY. UNCOVER SECRETS BY NIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been assigned as an intern to an isolated observatory on Mount Clearveil; Professor Elias was supposed to welcome you, but the observatory is silent… and something is wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this psychological <strong>cosmic horror</strong> experience, you manage the observatory during the day and follow the traces of Professor Elias’s forbidden connection with the stars at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE THE OBSERVATORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old devices, scattered notes, and unfinished experiments await you; as an intern, will you be able to handle the weight of this system?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492080/extras/7861cc3f94711c554a5c0d7c67d29d3e.poster.avif?t=1783853271\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492080/extras/7861cc3f94711c554a5c0d7c67d29d3e.webm?t=1783853271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492080/extras/7861cc3f94711c554a5c0d7c67d29d3e.mp4?t=1783853271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HANDLE DAILY TASKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You collect trash, grow and harvest crops, and try to keep the observatory clean and operational; yet the cursed symbols on the walls remind you that this place was never ordinary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492080/extras/ed221286f239b2d1601e7e3d19dd91e2.poster.avif?t=1783853271\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492080/extras/ed221286f239b2d1601e7e3d19dd91e2.webm?t=1783853271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492080/extras/ed221286f239b2d1601e7e3d19dd91e2.mp4?t=1783853271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTROL THE POWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, you cannot understand why keeping the lights on is so important… until you are left alone in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492080/extras/73c950d9458bb56d148812e8429e2c78.poster.avif?t=1783853271\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492080/extras/73c950d9458bb56d148812e8429e2c78.webm?t=1783853271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492080/extras/73c950d9458bb56d148812e8429e2c78.mp4?t=1783853271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER THE OBSERVATORY’S SECRETS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A path that opens at night leads you beneath the basement and into the buried secrets of the observatory; to uncover them, you must be brave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492080/extras/e376073b6922dc6240e55f94a407689d.poster.avif?t=1783853271\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492080/extras/e376073b6922dc6240e55f94a407689d.webm?t=1783853271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492080/extras/e376073b6922dc6240e55f94a407689d.mp4?t=1783853271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU ARE NOT ALONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You think you are the one observing… but perhaps <strong>you are the one being observed</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492080/extras/02e997e80ee7ae622b22aff03b63b6fb.poster.avif?t=1783853271\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492080/extras/02e997e80ee7ae622b22aff03b63b6fb.webm?t=1783853271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492080/extras/02e997e80ee7ae622b22aff03b63b6fb.mp4?t=1783853271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>You are trapped. <br>Over time, you begin to lose your sense of reality. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you be able to escape this observatory, or will you answer the call of the stars?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life &amp; Shadow: Celestial Call</strong> is an experience where calm and fear, science and madness intertwine.<br><br><br><strong>WHAT AWAITS YOU IN THIS PROLOGUE?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 Hours of Story Gameplay:</strong> A suspenseful and immersive introductory experience where you step into the atmosphere of the main game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save System:</strong> Your progress is saved every night when your character sleeps, allowing you to safely continue the story after every surviving day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dr. Elias's Secrets:</strong> Delve into the depths of the observatory and take your first steps into Dr. Elias's dark past and forbidden experiments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Complete Beginning:</strong> An exciting opening that lays the foundations of the story and builds anticipation for the full game. </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PREPARE BY DAY. UNCOVER SECRETS BY NIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been assigned as an intern to an isolated observatory on Mount Clearveil; Professor Elias was supposed to welcome you, but the observatory is silent… and something is wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this psychological <strong>cosmic horror</strong> experience, you manage the observatory during the day and follow the traces of Professor Elias’s forbidden connection with the stars at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE THE OBSERVATORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old devices, scattered notes, and unfinished experiments await you; as an intern, will you be able to handle the weight of this system?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492080/extras/7861cc3f94711c554a5c0d7c67d29d3e.poster.avif?t=1783853271\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492080/extras/7861cc3f94711c554a5c0d7c67d29d3e.webm?t=1783853271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492080/extras/7861cc3f94711c554a5c0d7c67d29d3e.mp4?t=1783853271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HANDLE DAILY TASKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You collect trash, grow and harvest crops, and try to keep the observatory clean and operational; yet the cursed symbols on the walls remind you that this place was never ordinary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492080/extras/ed221286f239b2d1601e7e3d19dd91e2.poster.avif?t=1783853271\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492080/extras/ed221286f239b2d1601e7e3d19dd91e2.webm?t=1783853271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492080/extras/ed221286f239b2d1601e7e3d19dd91e2.mp4?t=1783853271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTROL THE POWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, you cannot understand why keeping the lights on is so important… until you are left alone in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492080/extras/73c950d9458bb56d148812e8429e2c78.poster.avif?t=1783853271\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492080/extras/73c950d9458bb56d148812e8429e2c78.webm?t=1783853271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492080/extras/73c950d9458bb56d148812e8429e2c78.mp4?t=1783853271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER THE OBSERVATORY’S SECRETS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A path that o