rong> is an experience where calm and fear, science and madness intertwine.<br><br><br><strong>WHAT AWAITS YOU IN THIS PROLOGUE?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 Hours of Story Gameplay:</strong> A suspenseful and immersive introductory experience where you step into the atmosphere of the main game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save System:</strong> Your progress is saved every night when your character sleeps, allowing you to safely continue the story after every surviving day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dr. Elias's Secrets:</strong> Delve into the depths of the observatory and take your first steps into Dr. Elias's dark past and forbidden experiments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Complete Beginning:</strong> An exciting opening that lays the foundations of the story and builds anticipation for the full game. </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "You are trapped in the observatory of a star-obsessed professor atop Mount Clearveil. Plan your survival during the day, confront the darkness of the basement at night. Can you break the ritual and uncover the mystery?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Norwegian, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Swedish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492080/a2f304cc326d74624f3a0e61cd9d520cdd32b340/header.jpg?t=1783853271", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492080/bbc6c356e717e934af8bb0f953815c5ecb8b2400/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783853271", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4492080/bbc6c356e717e934af8bb0f953815c5ecb8b2400/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=178385327